      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "The target is the national monthly Total Participants count for women, infants, and children, as published without seasonal adjustment. The matching series also appears in Keydata Table 21: Special Supplemental Nutrition Program (WIC). HistoricalContext contains current published monthly observations from the September 11, 2026 data vintage, not certified original first prints. Archived initial-month Keydata vintages are separately identified as early-vintage proxies."
      },
      {
        "kind": "tool",
